{"type":"FeatureCollection","municipality_code":"44322","pref":"大分県","city":"姫島村","display_comment":"姫島村には、地域の歴史や暮らしを伝える案内板や石碑があり、それらを手がかりに街歩きを楽しめます。 まずは社寺・石碑・案内板に目を向けると、地域の由緒をたどる手がかりが見つけやすいでしょう。 現地では石碑、地蔵、地域資料館、公民館の由緒板を既存ピンと照らし合わせながら歩くと、見落としがちな地域の物語に出会いやすくなります。 ゆかりの人物では西村英一に注目すると、地域に残る文化や時代背景をさらに深く知るきっかけになります。 「姫島七不思議」や「浮洲」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","layer_counts":{"public_facilities":8,"scenic_nature_areas":3,"tourism_resources":5},"total_features":16,"features":[{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"public_facilities","name":"老人憩いの家","category":"public","address":"姫島村1634-1","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"44322","municipality_pref":"大分県","municipality_name":"姫島村","municipality_code_method":"source_exact_coord"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[131.64533776,33.72421171]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"public_facilities","name":"軽スポーツセンター","category":"public","address":"姫島村1681-2","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"44322","municipality_pref":"大分県","municipality_name":"姫島村","municipality_code_method":"source_exact_coord"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[131.6439585,33.72585041]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"public_facilities","name":"健康管理センター","category":"public","address":"姫島村姫島","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"44322","municipality_pref":"大分県","municipality_name":"姫島村","municipality_code_method":"source_exact_coord"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[131.68359514,33.73560938]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"public_facilities","name":"姫島村役場","category":"public","address":"姫島村1630-1","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"44322","municipality_pref":"大分県","municipality_name":"姫島村","municipality_code_method":"source_exact_coord"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[131.645515,33.724468]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"public_facilities","name":"中央公民館","category":"public","address":"姫島村948-3","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_c